  "notes": "Iblis never drawn; no motif during his speech. «فبما أغويتني» is not paraphrased (Al-Muyassar's «فبسبب ما أضللتني» would show his claim as a statement); 16:1-3 carries As-Sa'di's «لما أُبْلِسَ وأَيِسَ». 15 carries As-Sa'di's wisdom of the respite; an hourglass for «المنظرين». Hell: nothing literal. STAGING v4: Staging v4: kept ambient. 14-18 are Iblis's request for respite, his vow against the children of Adam and his expulsion: the unseen; Iblis is never drawn, and no people are staged under his vow (17), so nothing reads as him coming at them. The hourglass (the respite) now draws on at 15:4, not on 15:1 where Allah's reply begins."
 },
